{{!
    @template tool_vae/organisation_notice

    A sentence of the page of the organisation in an information box that has no button to close it.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\organisation_notice. The template holds no logic. Every
    value is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * text - string, the sentence

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "These figures are counts: the panel alone decides."
    }
}}
<div class="alert alert-info">{{text}}</div>
